.org/t/p/original/ivYpQFA8bvsKcz8NpN6gYbQcaT4.jpg"},{"id":100954,"name":"Gianni Franco","role":"Commissaro di Polizia","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wbMI5l9SG5WVLRQExFD4mdq7pWH.jpg"},{"id":240130,"name":"Éva Henger","role":"Annunciatrice televisiva chat-line","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/drrMLcirQB9MRhhR8HilA36XsJF.jpg"},{"id":106345,"name":"Neri Parenti","role":"Detenuto che mangia","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cTozY7rhX7S6nfvWb5A7UhIFBKB.jpg"},{"id":128419,"name":"Tony Brennero","role":"Mariachi Messicano","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wbSgWMN26qYc3Xyqn4hG8U6Bb7T.jpg"},{"id":1849303,"name":"Girolamo Di Stolfo","role":"Pony Rapid","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ND6LPUI3Yjt9YXcGSUbAX7e7sH.jpg"},{"id":3571103,"name":"Albert Colajanni","role":"Massimo D'Alema"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Abbiamo lasciato Fantozzi in Paradiso, ma i suoi guai non sono finiti lì. In Paradiso, infatti, c'è sovrapopolazione e ovviamente a farne le spese sarà proprio il ragioniere più famoso d'Italia. Tornato sulla Terra, riprende il tran-tran di sempre, con alcune conferme (i compagni d'ufficio) e qualche novità, naturalmente non piacevole. La nipote Uga viene rapita e costringe Fantozzi ad addentrarsi in uno sconosciuto e degradato mondo giovanile. La moda delle chat-line lo contagia al punto di innamorarsi perdutamente di una telefonista che scopre essere la Pina. La signorina Silvani lo accusa di averla messa incinta, mentre il megapresidente lo coinvolge in un processo per corruzione.","tagline":"Povero Fantozzi, non può godersi neanche il paradiso!"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Fantozzi The Return","overview":"Ugo Fantozzi has been ejected from Heaven and is sent back to Earth for a short period of time until the staff in Heaven can get Fantozzi a place there. Fantozzi goes through a variety of unfortunate experiences, such as rescuing his retro punk granddaughter Uga, and having to pay a vast telephone bill due to frequent chat line conversations. He ends up getting arrested instead of his ex-boss, who was originally charged with corruption. Just as he is about to enjoy the World Cup Final with Italy, he is called back into Heaven. Can he find peace once again?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sL0Ay3GQZRup2xOPkL63qujgzgh.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k4WfbmcyIJEW7U5ELt0wgVNr6g.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":41668,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sL0Ay3GQZRup2xOPkL63qujgzgh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sL0Ay3GQZRup2xOPkL63qujgzgh.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sL0Ay3GQZRup2xOPkL63qujgzgh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sL0Ay3GQZRup2xOPkL63qujgzgh.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5smZUNjabqodMJGu2IvLYHnkTKn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5smZUNjabqodMJGu2IvLYHnkTKn.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/itMNfWxElcUNn46WY8yma082ZTr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/itMNfWxElcUNn46WY8yma082ZTr.jpg","language":"it","width":512,"height":768},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jtGRvTWZP4VfPFK1tcGr9I36udz.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jtGRvTWZP4VfPFK1tcGr9I36udz.jpg","language":"it","width":761,"height":1087},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hDbaG6A3p9QJByo2p48DhHZx0f3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hDbaG6A